id:                     DRAFT-libcdio-paranoia-10.2-2.0.2-ohos-autotools
trigger_tool:           configure|make|conan|libtool|test
phase:                  configuration|linking|testing|packaging
error_signature:        cannot guess build type|OS.*ohos.*not recognized|could not setup config files machinery|BOING\.BIN.*No such file|//lib/.*\.la|start track.*not one
severity:               2
category:               ohos, hmdfs, autotools, conan, testing
affected_scope:         OHOS aarch64 Conan Autotools packages using libcdio 2.3.0 BIN/CUE fixtures
match_keywords:         HarmonyOS, linux-ohos, umask 077, BOING.BIN, BIN/CUE, track 07, libtool .la, private prefix
title:                  libcdio-paranoia OHOS Autotools、HMDFS 与 BIN/CUE fixture 适配
root_cause:             旧版 Autotools helper 不识别 OHOS；HMDFS 不接受 configure 的私有 umask 临时目录；发布 CUE fixture 引用缺失 BIN；libcdio BIN/CUE 驱动会从 image entry 1 重新编号；依赖 .la 携带构建机绝对路径。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/l/libcdio-paranoia/10.2-2.0.2 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           ohos-autotools-triplet-hmdfs-fixture-and-private-dependency-prefix
rec_description:        对 config.guess/config.sub/configure 做最小 OHOS/HMDFS 补丁，修复实际随包发布的 CUE 文件名和 endian 生成 CUE，使用六个 data entry 保持音频轨道 7/8/9，并把静态 libcdio 归档注入 build_folder 私有前缀以绕过 .la 绝对路径。
rec_command:            zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh archives/l/libcdio-paranoia/10.2-2.0.2
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      inspect-configure-and-bincue-backend
fallback_description:   若构建仍失败，先分别核对 config.guess/config.sub、configure 临时目录权限、CUE FILE 路径和 lib/driver/image/bincue.c 的 track numbering，不要先修改生产库断言。
forbid_1_pattern:       delete.*assert|skip.*all.*test|use.*shared.*libcdio.*la|inject.*usr/local|replace.*BOING.*with.*dummy
forbid_1_reason:        这些做法会隐藏真实平台限制、重新引入不可复现的 .la 路径或降低上游测试有效性。
forbid_1_consequence:   离线回归测试失去覆盖，或 CI 干净环境链接到不存在的系统路径。
